      "writtenOn": "2020-01-17T02:34:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Nope, usually tethering\u0027s regexs are : rndis, usb (tetherableUsbRegexs)\n              usb\u0027s : ncm (tetherableNcmRegexs)\n\nSo it won\u0027t work as you think.",
